N = 1 ranks, X 4x8, A 8x32 split into 32 columns per rank, B split into 32 rows per rank
max |Z - Z_ref|          (all-reduce)              = 0
max |Z - Z_ref|          (reduce-scatter+all-gather) = 0
max |dX - dX_ref|        (all-reduce in backward)  = 0
max |dA slice - ref|     (no communication)        = 0
max |tanh(sum) - sum(tanh)| (wrong split of A)     = 0
floats all-reduced per rank per step: 64 (forward 32 + backward 32); the wrong split would need 128 before tanh
MATCH (tolerance 1e-5)
